    "created_at": "2016-02-28T21:20:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-28T21:20:56Z",
    "body": "Yes, a _missing_ `alt` is a conformance error.  An empty `alt` indicates that the image needs no alt text because it's decorational (which includes \"is just visually representing something already depicted in surrounding text).\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
