    "updated_at": "2016-03-01T12:01:03Z",
    "body": "No... The spec allows omitting `alt` in some cases. Adding `alt=\"\"` means that the image is _not_ a key part of the content, but here it is.\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-img-element:attr-img-alt-8\n",
