    "updated_at": "2016-03-01T12:07:55Z",
    "body": "Maybe we could replace this with text instead of using images, with `<bdo dir=ltr>` as is done in e.g. https://w3c.github.io/webvtt/#example-4a66a3ef (\"What was his name again?\" example and the \"I’ve read the book\" example).\n",
