    "created_at": "2016-03-01T12:15:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-01T12:15:50Z",
    "body": "The spec allows omitting `alt` if the document is intended for a specific person (N/A for the spec itself), and for \"Images whose contents are not known\" (we do know what they contain).\n\nThis probably falls under \"Ancillary images\" where, if there's a caption, `alt` must _not_ be empty.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
